The files under bls/releases/ are publications of the U.S. Bureau of Labor
Statistics. The Bureau states that material on its website is in the public
domain unless otherwise noted and asks to be cited:
https://www.bls.gov/bls/copyright.htm
bls/manifest.json also records a FRASER copy of each release. FRASER is a
service of the Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis.

The files under g17/releases/, together with g17/release-calendar.html,
g17/revision-documentation.html, and g17/revision-vintages.txt, are
publications of the Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System:
https://www.federalreserve.gov/disclaimer.htm

The license above covers the author's materials. It does not apply to the
Bureau of Labor Statistics files, the Federal Reserve files, or the FRASER
copies, and it does not change their status.
